    "scenario": "A 14-year-old girl is transferred to the pediatric ICU for several days of unremitting fevers. She was recently treated for ruptured appendicitis with parenteral antibiotics via a peripherally inserted central catheter line. Which of the following criteria would most suggest infectious endocarditis?",
